 { White has more space in the centre, but Black has plans of their own. Find a simple prophylactic move here for White to cut out Black's intention of grabbing space. } 1. { -KEY- } a4 $1 { Correct! White's central space advantage is stable for now, so they first focus on preventing Black from getting their slice of the pie. } 
