dxe4 4. Nc4 Qe6 5. Ne3 Rc8 6. Qa4 $18 { White has far too many threats, and the fact that Black cannot castle without running into Be2-c4 leaves them without a plan and in a losing position. This brings the puzzle section to a close! Hope you enjoyed both the theory and practice sections of this important topic, and I'll see you in the next one. } 
